#!args apps/JFNetworker/tests/fixtures/dot1x_imap.jfnet --scenario apps/JFNetworker/tests/scen/dot1x_imap.scn --golden apps/JFNetworker/tests/scen/dot1x_imap.report
# golden scenario: two PCs on 802.1X ports of a switch, one refused; a laptop on a WPA2-Enterprise
# network whose PMK comes from EAP-PWD over RADIUS; a mail fetched and marked read over IMAP. The GUI
# program runs tests/scen/dot1x_imap.scn on tests/fixtures/dot1x_imap.jfnet without a window and ends
# with the report, which must equal tests/scen/dot1x_imap.report byte for byte on every target (CR
# LF there counts as LF; the script itself is not run).
